1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,333
Jesus

2
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:02,666
Yes, Felix?

3
00:00:02,666 --> 00:00:03,466
I'm worried

4
00:00:03,466 --> 00:00:04,799
about my future

5
00:00:04,799 --> 00:00:05,599
What are you

6
00:00:05,599 --> 00:00:06,666
worried about?

7
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:07,466
I'm worried about

8
00:00:07,466 --> 00:00:08,800
what I'll eat...

9
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,133
where I'll get money...

10
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:11,200
and...

11
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:13,066
and who I might lose.

12
00:00:13,066 --> 00:00:14,133
My child...

13
00:00:14,133 --> 00:00:14,933
Do not worry

14
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:16,533
about these things.

15
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:17,333
Look at the birds

16
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:18,666
in the sky

17
00:00:18,666 --> 00:00:20,533
They do not sow or reap.

18
00:00:20,533 --> 00:00:22,933
or store away in barns,

19
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:23,466
yet your

20
00:00:23,466 --> 00:00:25,866
Heavenly Father feeds them

21
00:00:25,866 --> 00:00:27,733
So do not be afraid.

22
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:29,866
Your Father knows what you need

23
00:00:29,866 --> 00:00:32,000
And I will be with you

24
00:00:33,866 --> 00:00:34,933
Thanks Jesus

